  "description": "Production-grade, high-throughput Kafka producer and consumer framework built on Confluent.Kafka. Producer: sharded/pooled dispatch with bounded-channel backpressure and multi-cluster named-producer support. Consumer: decoupled poll/process pipeline with pluggable batching, retry, dead-letter, and metrics strategies, plus first-class ASP.NET Core / generic-host background-worker integration for running multiple independently-configured consumers per process.",
